// A kind of actor (`content::actors::ActorSpec`): the map glyph that
// places it (any lowercase letter without a meaning of its own), the
// behaviour it runs (none for the player), its hit points, its weapon
// (`Sweep` is `assets/weapons/sweep.ron`) or fighting style (`Blade` is
// `assets/moves/blade.ron`), and what a blow knocks out of it (an effect:
// `Blood` is `assets/effects/blood.ron`).
(glyph: 'p', hp: 2, moves: Blade, bleeds: Blood)
